-to-right across each line, then jump back to the start of the next line. These eye movements (saccades) consume about 20% of your reading time. RSVP eliminates this overhead by presenting words in a fixed position."}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Fast Read also highlights the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Optimal Recognition Point (ORP)"}]," in each word — the character position where your eye naturally focuses for fastest recognition."]}]]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7"]}],["$L8"],"$L9"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],"$La",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$b",[]],"s":false,"S":true}
